WEBVTT

00:18:29.880 --> 00:18:32.576
If all the people who were
talking over this period

00:18:32.600 --> 00:18:33.816
worked on a car together,

00:18:33.840 --> 00:18:36.520
it would be a joy, absolute joy.

00:18:38.040 --> 00:18:40.880
So there's a new X-light system
I'm doing in Japan.

00:18:42.000 --> 00:18:46.696
There's Tuareg shoes from North Africa.
There's a Kifwebe mask.

00:18:46.720 --> 00:18:48.280
These are my sculptures.

00:18:49.240 --> 00:18:50.936
A copper jelly mold.

00:18:50.960 --> 00:18:52.696
(Laughter)

00:18:52.720 --> 00:18:55.292
It sounds like some quiz show
or something, doesn't it?

00:18:57.440 --> 00:18:58.640
So, it's going to end.